{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JiU1EbBnAJi5h4Sp6zX6Wo","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_3/projects/gen-depth-fingerprint/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-20\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- exp_056b_qlora_qwen_base: Within-model QLoRA on Qwen3-1.7B base data establishes per-model baseline for instruct comparison; expected 3-class F1 comparable to pooled base QLoRA (0.905) with potential variance from smaller per-model dataset（准备中）\\\\n- exp_055b_qlora_olmo_base: Within-model QLoRA on OLMo-2-1B base data establishes per-model baseline for instruct comparison; expected 3-class F1 comparable to pooled base QLoRA (0.905) with potential variance from smaller per-model dataset（准备中）\\\\n- exp_056_qlora_qwen_instruct: QLoRA end-to-end classifier on Qwen3-1.7B-Instruct generation data recovers depth signal partially: 3-class F1 lower than base QLoRA (0.905) due to instruct-tuning compressing depth features, but higher than XGBoost on instruct features (0.732)（准备中）\\\\n- exp_055_qlora_olmo_instruct: QLoRA end-to-end classifier on OLMo-2-0425-1B-Instruct generation data recovers depth signal partially: 3-class F1 lower than base QLoRA (0.905) due to instruct-tuning compressing depth features, but higher than XGBoost on instruct features (0.575)（准备中）\\\\n- exp_054_instruct_llama3_2_3b: Instruct-tuned Llama-3.2-3B-Instruct shows degraded depth signal vs base Llama-3.2-3B (F1=0.697), quantifying instruction-tuning's impact on DDR（准备中）\\\\n- exp_053_instruct_olmo2_1b: Instruct-tuned OLMo-2-1B-Instruct shows degraded depth signal vs base OLMo-2-1B (F1=0.695), quantifying instruction-tuning's impact on DDR（准备中）\\\\n- exp_052_instruct_qwen3_1_7b: Instruct-tuned Qwen3-1.7B (chat template, thinking=off) shows degraded depth signal vs base Qwen3-1.7B (F1=0.709), quantifying instruction-tuning's impact on DDR（准备中）\\\\n- multi_domain_t07（准备中）\\\\n- review-exp-a-baseline-ensemble: 审稿回应实验A：4-baseline ensemble + 统一超参对比，验证 7-feature vs 4-baseline vs 6-feature 在公平条件下的性能差异（准备中）\\\\n- plan-004-prep: Downstream utility 准备：depth-stratified 数据集 + OLMo-1B fine-tuning 脚本（不开跑，等 Director 确认）（准备中）\\\\n- …另有 5 项\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **exp_057_scale_9gen_logo** (success): Depth signal persists at 7B+ scale: Qwen3-8B-Base generation chains exhibit DDR patterns (drifting central-tendency, stationary shape features) comparable to sub-3B models, and adding Qwen3-8B as 9th generator to LOGO evaluation maintains or improves ensemble F1, ruling out scale-dependent signal collapse\\\\n- **exp_057** (success): Depth signal persists at 7B+ scale: Qwen3-8B-Base generation chains exhibit DDR patterns (drifting central-tendency, stationary shape features) comparable to sub-3B models, and adding Qwen3-8B as 9th generator to LOGO evaluation maintains or improves ensemble F1, ruling out scale-dependent signal collapse\\\\n- **exp_058_ddr_causality** (success): DDR features have causal predictive power for depth beyond correlation: permutation importance confirms each feature group (drifting/stationary) contributes independently, and Granger causality tests show depth-t features predict depth-(t+1) features beyond autoregressive baseline, establishing temporal causal direction in the generation chain\\\\n  [ddr_causal_analysis](/api/workspace-files/projects/gen-depth-fingerprint/artifacts/exp_058_ddr_causality/intermediate/ddr_causal_analysis.py)\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 38 / 负向 1 / 失败 9 / 共 49\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nbjb2-18868: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- plan-002-qwen3-1_7b-s0: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- plan-002-qwen3-1_7b-s1: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- plan-002-qwen17b-s0: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- plan-002-qwen17b-s1: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- plan-002-qwen17b-retry-s0: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- plan-002-qwen17b-retry-s1: 