{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01GFXzV2Uq6EeDTh78Hmvpgx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01R52n2SyEYSDwaY7uu9Ae7o","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_3/projects/gen-depth-fingerprint/artifacts/_project/paper/appendix_qlora.tex"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":14311,"cache_read_input_tokens":24523,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":14311,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Aa4LbC8tVN8tPubtpYmsUq","session_id":"d4cded27-964c-4711-9220-b05f8309dff9","uuid":"cabeb4cb-8957-45d5-b0e3-e9e0abfde8b5"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01R52n2SyEYSDwaY7uu9Ae7o","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tTo assess whether depth signal extends beyond handcrafted features, we fine-tune a pretrained language model end-to-end as a depth classifier using QLoRA \\cite{qlora}.\n2\t\n3\t\\paragraph{Setup.}\n4\tWe fine-tune Qwen3-0.6B-Base with LoRA rank 16, learning rate $2 \\times 10^{-4}$, and 3 epochs, framing depth estimation as 5-class sequence classification (gen-0 through gen-4).\\footnote{Evaluated on the original 6-generator subset; XGBoost 3-class F1\\,=\\,0.789. We expect 8-generator training to further improve given additional diversity; the comparison direction is preserved.}\n5\tFor 3-class evaluation, we collapse predictions into gen-0\\,/\\,gen-1\\,/\\,gen-2+ post hoc.\n6\tAll results use the same LOGO protocol as the main experiments.\n7\t\n8\t\\begin{table}[h]\n9\t\\centering\n10\t\\small\n11\t\\caption{QLoRA end-to-end depth classification vs.\\ XGBoost on handcrafted features, under LOGO evaluation.}\n12\t\\label{tab:qlora}\n13\t\\resizebox{\\linewidth}{!}{%\n14\t\\begin{tabular}{lccc}\n15\t\\toprule\n16\t\\textbf{Method} & \\textbf{5-class F1} & \\textbf{3-class F1} & \\textbf{Per-class F1 (5-class)} \\\\\n17\t\\midrule\n18\tXGBoost (7 features) & 0.501 $\\pm$ 0.038 & 0.789 & --- \\\\\n19\tQLoRA (Qwen3-0.6B)   & 0.583 $\\pm$ 0.010 & 0.905 $\\pm$ 0.003 & 0.999\\,/\\,0.796\\,/\\,0.413\\,/\\,0.259\\,/\\,0.447 \\\\\n20\t\\bottomrule\n21\t\\end{tabular}}\n22\t\\end{table}\n23\t\n24\t\\paragraph{Results.}\n25\tQLoRA achieves 3-class LOGO F1\\,=\\,0.905 ($\\pm$0.003), a +11.6\\,pp improvement over the XGBoost baseline (0.789).\n26\tOn 5-class evaluation, QLoRA reaches F1\\,=\\,0.583 ($\\pm$0.010) vs.\\ 0.501 for XGBoost (+8.2\\,pp), with the largest gains at gen-1 (0.796 vs.\\ 0.634) and gen-2 (0.413 vs.\\ 0.268).\n27\tThe gen-2/gen-3 boundary remains the primary failure mode (gen-3 F1\\,=\\,0.259), consistent with the feature-level analysis in \\S\\ref{sec:discussion}.\n28\t\n29\t\\paragraph{Hyperparameter robustness.}\n30\tA second run with LoRA rank 32 and seed 123 yields 5-class F1\\,=\\,0.587 ($\\pm$0.005) and 3-class F1\\,=\\,0.905 ($\\pm$0.004), which confirms stability across hyperparameter and seed variation ($\\Delta < 1$\\,pp on both metrics).\n31\t\n32\t\\paragraph{Implications.}\n33\tThe substantial 3-class improvement demonstrates that raw token embeddings contain depth signal beyond what summary statistics capture; the seven handcrafted features are a strong but lossy compression of the full distributional information.\n34\tEnd-to-end fine-tuning exploits token-level patterns (e.g., positional regularities, n-gram repetitions) that aggregate features cannot represent.\n35\tThis confirms that the depth signal documented in our main analysis is real and exploitable beyond engineered features, while the handcrafted approach retains practical advantages: interpretability, computational efficiency (no GPU inference), and the ability to reveal the differential depth response pattern that motivates the task formulation.\n36\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Aa4LbC8tVN8tPubtpYmsUq","session_id":"d4cded27-964c-4711-9220-b05f8309dff9","uuid":"c79ee450-b6f1-4a28-b5e6-400ad926cc65","timestamp":"2026-05-20T10:44:27.232Z"}
