{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UZmfomn7GdHaAeTC4bSwJp","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tWe complement the permutation importance analysis (\\S\\ref{sec:results-differential}) with a leave-one-feature-out ablation. Each row drops one of the seven features and re-evaluates the full 6-gen LOGO protocol; $\\Delta$ is the change relative to the full 7-feature ensemble (F1\\,=\\,0.789).\n2\t\n3\t\\begin{table}[h]\n4\t\\centering\n5\t\\small\n6\t\\begin{tabular}{lcc}\n7\t\\toprule\n8\t\\textbf{Dropped feature} & \\textbf{LOGO F1} & $\\boldsymbol{\\Delta}$ \\textbf{vs Full} \\\\\n9\t\\midrule\n10\tentropy\\_max    & 0.774 & $-$1.50\\,pp \\\\\n11\tentropy\\_mean   & 0.783 & $-$0.63\\,pp \\\\\n12\tttr             & 0.784 & $-$0.55\\,pp \\\\\n13\thapax\\_ratio    & 0.785 & $-$0.42\\,pp \\\\\n14\ttail\\_decay     & 0.786 & $-$0.33\\,pp \\\\\n15\tentropy\\_std    & 0.786 & $-$0.29\\,pp \\\\\n16\tentropy\\_min    & 0.789 & $+$0.01\\,pp \\\\\n17\t\\midrule\n18\tFull (7 features) & 0.789 & --- \\\\\n19\t\\bottomrule\n20\t\\end{tabular}\n21\t\\caption{Leave-one-feature-out ablation (6-gen LOGO). Each row drops one feature and re-evaluates with the LOGO protocol. Sorted by impact magnitude.}\n22\t\\label{tab:lofo}\n23\t\\end{table}\n24\t\n25\t\\paragraph{Analysis.}\n26\tEntropy\\_max causes the largest degradation when removed ($-$1.5\\,pp), despite ranking only fourth in permutation importance (split frequency 0.063). This indicates that entropy\\_max provides unique signal (capturing the most surprising token under the reference model) that is not redundant with other features.\n27\tConversely, entropy\\_min is fully redundant ($\\Delta$\\,=\\,+0.01\\,pp), consistent with its near-zero permutation importance (0.015).\n28\tSix of seven features contribute positively to the ensemble, which confirms that the 7-feature design is not over-specified.\n29\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Aa4LbC8tVN8tPubtpYmsUq","session_id":"d4cded27-964c-4711-9220-b05f8309dff9","uuid":"b6f1b345-301a-43c2-932e-2a79b39fb8b3","timestamp":"2026-05-20T10:44:27.577Z"}
