{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Swm8EWkh5MfxBKDbxDW3hN","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_3/projects/gen-depth-fingerprint/literature_map.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Literature Map for gen-depth-fingerprint\\\\n# 递归 LLM 生成链深度指纹识别\\\\n# Updated: 2026-05-15\\\\n# Categories: detection, model-collapse, data-quality, stylometry,\\\\n#             iterative-generation, watermarking, vocabulary-diversity,\\\\n#             membership-inference, ood-detection, survey\\\\n# Total: 39 papers\\\\n\\\\n##############################################################################\\\\n# 1. Perplexity-based / Zero-shot Detection\\\\n##############################################################################\\\\n\\\\n- id: detectgpt\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"DetectGPT: Zero-Shot Machine-Generated Text Detection using Probability Curvature\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Mitchell et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2023\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"ICML 2023\\\\\\\"\\\\n  arxiv: \\\\\\\"2301.11305\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: detection\\\\n  role: background\\\\n  relevance: \\\\\\\"基础检测方法，用 log-probability curvature 区分人/机文本；本项目的 depth fingerprint 可与之互补\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_finding: \\\\\\\"机器生成文本倾向于占据模型 log-probability 函数的负曲率区域\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n- id: gltr\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"GLTR: Statistical Detection and Visualization of Generated Text\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Gehrmann et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2019\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"ACL 2019\\\\\\\"\\\\n  arxiv: \\\\\\\"1906.04043\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: detection\\\\n  role: background\\\\n  relevance: \\\\\\\"早期统计检测工具，使用 token rank/entropy 等特征；本项目可对比其特征在不同生成深度下的变化\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_finding: \\\\\\\"使用 token 概率排名和熵的可视化方案将人类检测准确率从 54% 提升到 72%\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n- id: dna_gpt\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"DNA-GPT: Divergent N-Gram Analysis for Training-Free Detection of GPT-Generated Text\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Yang et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2024\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"ICLR 2024\\\\\\\"\\\\n  arxiv: \\\\\\\"2305.17359\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: detection\\\\n  role: background\\\\n  relevance: \\\\\\\"通过 n-gram 发散度做 zero-shot 检测；本项目 depth fingerprint 中的 diversity 指标可借鉴其 n-gram 分析\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_finding: \\\\\\\"截断文本后让 LLM 重新生成，通过 n-gram 差异实现零样本检测\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n- id: binoculars\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Spotting LLMs With Binoculars: Zero-Shot Detection of Machine-Generated Text\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Hans et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2024\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"ICML 2024\\\\\\\"\\\\n  arxiv: \\\\\\\"2401.12070\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: detection\\\\n  role: background\\\\n  relevance: \\\\\\\"双模型对比打分检测法；depth fingerprint 需要验证与 Binoculars score 在不同深度下的相关性\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_finding: \\\\\\\"对比两个近似 LLM 的 perplexity 比值可在 0.01% FPR 下检测 90%+ 的 ChatGPT 输出\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n- id: fast_detectgpt\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Fast-DetectGPT: Efficient Zero-Shot Detection of Machine-Generated Text via Conditional Probability Curvature\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Bao et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2024\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"ICLR 2024\\\\\\\"\\\\n  arxiv: \\\\\\\"2310.05130\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: detection\\\\n  role: background\\\\n  relevance: \\\\\\\"DetectGPT 加速版，用采样替代扰动；可作为 depth fingerprint pipeline 中的快速 baseline\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_finding: \\\\\\\"用条件概率曲率替代扰动步骤，检测速度提升 340 倍，性能相对提升 75%\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n- id: ld_score\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Beyond Perplexity: Character Distribution Signatures and the MDTA Benchmark for AI Text Detection\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Narayanasamy et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2026\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv preprint\\\\\\\"\\\\n  arxiv: \\\\\\\"2605.01647\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: detection\\\\n  role: method-component\\\\n  relevance: \\\\\\\"字符级分布特征 (LD-Score) 与 perplexity 正交（r=0.08-0.13）；可作为 depth fingerprint 的互补信号\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_finding: \\\\\\\"LLM 近似全局字符分布而人类展示领域特化分布，形成可检测的 Wall of Separation\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n- id: intrinsic_dimension\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Intrinsic Dimension Estimation for Robust Detection of AI-Generated Texts\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Tulchinskii et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2023\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"NeurIPS 2023\\\\\\\"\\\\n  arxiv: \\\\\\\"2306.04723\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: detection\\\\n  role: method-component\\\\n  relevance: \\\\\\\"用嵌入空间内在维度做检测；depth fingerprint 可探索内在维度随生成深度的变化趋势\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_finding: \\\\\\\"人类文本嵌入的内在维度约 9（字母语言），AI 文本约低 1.5；跨域/跨模型稳定\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n- id: diveye\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Diversity Boosts AI-Generated Text Detection\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Basani & Chen\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2026\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"TMLR 2026\\\\\\\"\\\\n  arxiv: \\\\\\\"2509.18880\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: detection\\\\n  role: method-component\\\\n  relevance: \\\\\\\"用 surprisal diversity 特征检测 AI 文本——人类文本 surprisal 分布离散度更高、尾部更重；与本项目 shape 特征（entropy_std, tail_decay）直接可比\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_finding: \\\\\\\"DivEye 框架捕捉 token surprisal 的波动模式，zero-shot 检测超现有方法最多 33.2%，对改写鲁棒\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n- id: generator_barrier\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Breaking the Generator Barrier: Disentangled Representation for Generalizable AI-Text Detection\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Pu et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2026\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv preprint\\\\\\\"\\\\n  arxiv: \\\\\\\"2604.13692\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: detection\\\\n  role: background\\\\n  relevance: \\\\\\\"通过解耦表征实现跨生成器泛化检测（MAGE 20 个 LLM），与本项目 LOGO 跨生成器评估目标一致；不同方法论（表征学习 vs 特征工程）\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_finding: \\\\\\\"解耦 AI 检测语义与生成器特有伪影，在未见生成器上准确率提升 24.2%、F1 提升 26.2%\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n- id: feat_aug_transformer\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Feature-Augmented Transformers for Robust AI-Text Detection Across Domains and Generators\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Mady et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2026\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv preprint\\\\\\\"\\\\n  arxiv: \\\\\\\"2605.03969\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: detection\\\\n  role: background\\\\n  relevance: \\\\\\\"语言特征增强 Transformer 做跨域/跨生成器检测（DeBERTa+FeatAttn 85.9% bal-acc on M4）；验证了语言特征对泛化性的价值，支撑本项目特征工程路线\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_finding: \\\\\\\"基模型域内近满分但迁移脆弱；attention-based 语言特征融合显著提升跨分布迁移能力\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n##############################################################################\\\\n# 2. Model Collapse Theory\\\\n##############################################################################\\\\n\\\\n- id: self_consuming_mad\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Self-Consuming Generative Models Go MAD\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Alemohammad et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2023\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv preprint\\\\\\\"\\\\n  arxiv: \\\\\\\"2307.01850\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: model-collapse\\\\n  role: background\\\\n  relevance: \\\\\\\"定义 autophagous loop 三种模式并证明精度/多样性递减；本项目的 depth fingerprint 可量化此递减\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_finding: \\\\\\\"无足够新鲜真实数据时，自噬循环导致生成质量（精度）或多样性（召回）逐步下降\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n- id: curse_of_recursion\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"The Curse of Recursion: Training on Generated Data Makes Models Forget\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Shumailov et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2024\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"Nature 2024\\\\\\\"\\\\n  arxiv: \\\\\\\"2305.17493\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: model-collapse\\\\n  role: background\\\\n  relevance: \\\\\\\"Nature 发表的 model collapse 里程碑论文；本项目关注推理链（非训练循环）的类似退化现象\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_finding: \\\\\\\"递归训练导致不可逆缺陷——原始分布的尾部消失，在 VAE/GMM/LLM 中普遍存在\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n- id: strong_model_collapse\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Strong Model Collapse\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Dohmatob et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2024\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"ICLR 2025\\\\\\\"\\\\n  arxiv: \\\\\\\"2410.04840\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: model-collapse\\\\n  role: background\\\\n  relevance: \\\\\\\"证明即使 1% 合成数据也会导致 collapse，更大模型可能放大效应；支撑 depth fingerprint 的理论动机\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_finding: \\\\\\\"最小比例合成数据即可导致 strong collapse；更大模型在简化体制下可放大此效应\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n- id: model_collapse_avoidable\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Is Model Collapse Inevitable? Breaking the Curse of Recursion by Accumulating Real and Synthetic Data\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Gerstgrasser et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2024\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv preprint\\\\\\\"\\\\n  arxiv: \\\\\\\"2404.01413\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: model-collapse\\\\n  role: background\\\\n  relevance: \\\\\\\"证明累积数据时 collapse 可避免；本项目的生成链场景是纯推理无累积，collapse 更难避免\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_finding: \\\\\\\"当数据累积而非替换时，混合真实与合成数据可避免 model collapse\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n##############################################################################\\\\n# 3. OOD Detection\\\\n##############################################################################\\\\n\\\\n- id: ood_baseline\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"A Baseline for Detecting Misclassified and Out-of-Distribution Examples in Neural Networks\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Hendrycks & Gimpel\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2017\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"ICLR 2017\\\\\\\"\\\\n  arxiv: \\\\\\\"1610.02136\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: ood-detection\\\\n  role: background\\\\n  relevance: \\\\\\\"OOD 检测基线方法；depth fingerprint 可视为 OOD scoring 的一种特殊形式——检测偏离人类分布的程度\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_finding: \\\\\\\"正确分类样本的最大 softmax 概率高于错误分类和 OOD 样本\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n##############################################################################\\\\n# 4. Data Quality Scoring\\\\n##############################################################################\\\\n\\\\n- id: dsir\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Data Selection for Language Models via Importance Resampling\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Xie et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2023\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"NeurIPS 2023\\\\\\\"\\\\n  arxiv: \\\\\\\"2302.03169\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: data-quality\\\\n  role: background\\\\n  relevance: \\\\\\\"数据质量筛选框架；depth fingerprint 可作为 DSIR 类 pipeline 中合成数据污染度的质量信号\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_finding: \\\\\\\"用 n-gram 特征空间的重要性权重做数据选择，100M 文档 4.5 小时处理\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n- id: qurating\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"QuRating: Selecting High-Quality Data for Training Language Models\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Wettig et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2024\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"ICML 2024\\\\\\\"\\\\n  arxiv: \\\\\\\"2402.09739\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: data-quality\\\\n  role: background\\\\n  relevance: \\\\\\\"LLM 成对判断的数据质量评分；depth fingerprint 类似地为文本分配生成深度分数\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_finding: \\\\\\\"LLM 可准确判断文本的写作风格/专业性/教育价值等质量维度，用于预训练数据选择\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n- id: ccnet\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"CCNet: Extracting High Quality Monolingual Datasets from Web Crawl Data\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Wenzek et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2020\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"LREC 2020\\\\\\\"\\\\n  arxiv: \\\\\\\"1911.00359\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: data-quality\\\\n  role: background\\\\n  relevance: \\\\\\\"基于 perplexity 的 web 数据过滤 pipeline；depth fingerprint 可集成为额外的质量过滤维度\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_finding: \\\\\\\"用语言模型 perplexity 过滤 Common Crawl 数据，接近维基百科质量水平\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n##############################################################################\\\\n# 5. Watermarking\\\\n##############################################################################\\\\n\\\\n- id: watermark_llm\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"A Watermark for Large Language Models\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Kirchenbauer et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2023\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"ICML 2023\\\\\\\"\\\\n  arxiv: \\\\\\\"2301.10226\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: watermarking\\\\n  role: background\\\\n  relevance: \\\\\\\"绿色 token 列表 watermark 方案；depth fingerprint 检测非水印场景下的生成痕迹，形成互补\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_finding: \\\\\\\"通过在采样前划分 green/red token 列表实现不可见水印，短文本即可检测\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n- id: synthid_text\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Scalable Watermarking for Identifying Large Language Model Outputs\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Dathathri et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2024\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"Nature 2024\\\\\\\"\\\\n  arxiv: \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: watermarking\\\\n  role: background\\\\n  relevance: \\\\\\\"生产级 LLM 水印方案（Google Gemini 部署）；depth fingerprint 面向无水印的 post-hoc 检测\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_finding: \\\\\\\"Tournament Sampling 算法实现生产级文本水印，Google Gemini 实际部署\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n- id: aaronson_watermark\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Watermarking GPT Outputs\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Aaronson & Kirchner\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2022\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"Technical Talk\\\\\\\"\\\\n  arxiv: \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: watermarking\\\\n  role: background\\\\n  relevance: \\\\\\\"LLM 文本水印的原始提案；depth fingerprint 定位为不依赖水印的被动检测方案\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_finding: \\\\\\\"用伪随机函数选择 next token，对短文本即可检测，对轻微编辑鲁棒\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n- id: chainwash\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Chainwash: Multi-Step Rewriting Attacks on Diffusion Language Model Watermarks\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Ameen et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2026\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv preprint\\\\\\\"\\\\n  arxiv: \\\\\\\"2605.05503\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: watermarking\\\\n  role: background\\\\n  relevance: \\\\\\\"多步重写链攻击水印（5 hop 后检测率从 87.9% 降到 4.86%）；证明生成链深度影响水印信号，支撑 depth fingerprint 的动机——被动检测不依赖水印\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_finding: \\\\\\\"链式重写（chainwash）通过生成式多步改写有效消除扩散语言模型水印，5 步后 94.76% 原可检测文本不再被标记\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n##############################################################################\\\\n# 6. Vocabulary Diversity\\\\n##############################################################################\\\\n\\\\n- id: curious_decline\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"The Curious Decline of Linguistic Diversity: Training Language Models on Synthetic Text\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Guo et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2024\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"NAACL 2024 Findings\\\\\\\"\\\\n  arxiv: \\\\\\\"2311.09807\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: vocabulary-diversity\\\\n  role: direct-competitor\\\\n  relevance: \\\\\\\"直接相关：量化递归微调导致的词汇/句法/语义多样性下降；本项目扩展到推理链场景\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_finding: \\\\\\\"递归微调导致词汇/句法/语义多样性持续下降，创意任务尤为显著\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n- id: writing_diversity\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Does Writing with Language Models Reduce Content Diversity?\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Padmakumar & He\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2024\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"ICLR 2024\\\\\\\"\\\\n  arxiv: \\\\\\\"2309.05196\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: vocabulary-diversity\\\\n  role: background\\\\n  relevance: \\\\\\\"实验证明 InstructGPT 协写降低多样性；支撑 depth fingerprint 中 diversity 随深度递减的假设\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_finding: \\\\\\\"InstructGPT 协写显著降低不同作者间的文本相似度和词汇多样性\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n- id: nucleus_sampling\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"The Curious Case of Neural Text Degeneration\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Holtzman et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2020\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"ICLR 2020\\\\\\\"\\\\n  arxiv: \\\\\\\"1904.09751\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: vocabulary-diversity\\\\n  role: background\\\\n  relevance: \\\\\\\"定义了 neural text degeneration 和 nucleus sampling；depth fingerprint 中的 shape 特征与采样策略相关\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_finding: \\\\\\\"最大化解码导致退化；Nucleus Sampling 截断不可靠尾部，生成质量接近人类\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n- id: mapping_llm_science\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Mapping the Increasing Use of LLMs in Scientific Papers\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Liang et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2024\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv preprint\\\\\\\"\\\\n  arxiv: \\\\\\\"2404.01268\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: vocabulary-diversity\\\\n  role: background\\\\n  relevance: \\\\\\\"大规模量化科学论文中 LLM 修改内容的比例；depth fingerprint 可检测多轮修改的深度\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_finding: \\\\\\\"95 万篇论文分析显示 CS 领域 LLM 修改率最高达 17.5%\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n- id: monitoring_ai_review\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Monitoring AI-Modified Content at Scale: A Case Study on the Impact of ChatGPT on AI Conference Peer Reviews\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Liang et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2024\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"ICML 2024\\\\\\\"\\\\n  arxiv: \\\\\\\"2403.07183\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: vocabulary-diversity\\\\n  role: background\\\\n  relevance: \\\\\\\"检测同行评审中 LLM 修改内容；depth fingerprint 提供互补的深度维度信号\\\\\\\"\\\\n  key_finding: \\\\\\\"6.5-16.9% 的 AI 会议 peer review 可能被 LLM 实质性修改\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n##############################################################################\\\\n# 7. Stylometry / Authorship Attribution\\\\n##############################################################################\\\\n\\\\n- id: stamatatos_survey\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"A Survey of Modern Authorship Attribution Methods\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: \\\\\\\"Stamatatos\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2009\\\\n  venue: \\\\\\\"JASIST 2009\\\\\\\"\\\\n  arxiv: \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n  category: stylometry\\\\n  role: background\\\\n  relevance: \\\\\\\"风格计量学经典综述；depth\\\\n\\\\n... [截断: 省略 4634 字符，传 max_chars=0 获取完整内容]\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 16634, \\\"truncated\\\": true}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01EZ7XgNSmgShPRBE4FY3tea","session_id":"d4cded27-964c-4711-9220-b05f8309dff9","uuid":"065ab810-762d-4caf-8c5a-b0ecb0e84164","timestamp":"2026-05-20T10:44:51.205Z"}
